+    /*
+     * The two option lists the admin modals are built from.
+     *
+     * These are here because they are the part that actually broke. The first
+     * version of the price-source list filtered with a HAVING over the
+     * withCount alias, which is a subquery in the SELECT list and not an
+     * aggregate — valid-looking code that threw the moment the modal opened,
+     * and invisible to every test that only exercised the generator.
